{
  "episode": "24",
  "lang": "en",
  "pages": [
    {
      "page": 1,
      "panels": {},
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p1-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "出勤より早えぞ。",
          "en": "This is earlier than work."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-1-2",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "初回の特典、逃したくないの。",
          "en": "I don't want to miss the first-show freebie."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-1-3",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "caption",
          "ja": "休日、朝。",
          "en": "Holiday morning."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "僕は追跡シーンが目当てです。",
          "en": "I'm here for the chase scene."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "私も、出勤より早いですよ。",
          "en": "It's earlier than work for me too."
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "課長、休日も先にいるのか！",
          "en": "Chief, you're ahead of us even on days off?!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-4-2",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "今日は点呼しませんよ。",
          "en": "No roll call today."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "panels": {},
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p2-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "隊長は、この中へ。",
          "en": "The Captain goes in here."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "まだいねえやつの家か！",
          "en": "A house for a guy who isn't even here yet?!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-2-2",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "来てから探したら遅いの。",
          "en": "It's too late to look for a case once he shows up."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "で、お前の椅子は？",
          "en": "So where's your chair?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "……ない。",
          "en": "...I don't have one."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-4-2",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "家主のほうが立ちっぱなし。",
          "en": "The homeowner is the one standing the whole time."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-5-1",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "袋も傷めず持って帰るの。",
          "en": "I'm taking the bag home undamaged too."
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-5-2",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "まだ袋も来てねえ。",
          "en": "The bag hasn't even arrived yet."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "panels": {},
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p3-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "ここに袋。こっちは台紙。",
          "en": "Bag here. Backing card over here."
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "パンはここな。",
          "en": "Bread goes here."
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "違う！",
          "en": "No!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "どれ、持ちます？",
          "en": "Which one, shall I hold it?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-4-2",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "そこ、触らないで。",
          "en": "Don't touch that."
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-5-1",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "僕はもう、持つ所がない。",
          "en": "I have nowhere left to hold."
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-6-1",
          "panel": 6,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "待って。全部しまうまで！",
          "en": "Wait. Not until everything's put away!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 4,
      "panels": {},
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p4-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "……ありがと。",
          "en": "...Thanks."
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-2-2",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "落ちたら、家がつぶれるぞ。",
          "en": "If it falls, the house gets crushed."
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "では、上映入口で。",
          "en": "Then, see you at the screening entrance."
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "朝飯が、せんべいになった！",
          "en": "My breakfast turned into a rice cracker!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-4-2",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "まだ映画、始まってないのよね。",
          "en": "And the movie hasn't even started yet."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 5,
      "panels": {},
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p5-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "お一人に一つです。",
          "en": "One per person."
        },
        {
          "id": "p5-1-2",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "caption",
          "ja": "入場者特典　全4種・ランダム",
          "en": "Freebie: 4 kinds, random"
        },
        {
          "id": "p5-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "私は向こうの席です。",
          "en": "My seat is over there."
        },
        {
          "id": "p5-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "おっ、でけえやつ！",
          "en": "Oh, a big one!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p5-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "ピコだ。",
          "en": "It's Pico."
        },
        {
          "id": "p5-5-1",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "……あ。",
          "en": "...Ah."
        },
        {
          "id": "p5-6-1",
          "panel": 6,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "テツ。ちょっと相談。",
          "en": "Tetsu. A quick favor."
        },
        {
          "id": "p5-6-2",
          "panel": 6,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "袋なら、やるぞ。",
          "en": "I'll give you the bag."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "panels": {},
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p6-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "これと隊長、交換しない？",
          "en": "Want to trade this for the Captain?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p6-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "隊長と掃除係じゃ、格が違う。",
          "en": "The Captain and the cleaner? Different ranks."
        },
        {
          "id": "p6-2-2",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "一個と一個でしょ。",
          "en": "It's one for one."
        },
        {
          "id": "p6-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "隊長はね、皆の前に立って――",
          "en": "The Captain stands in front of everyone and--"
        },
        {
          "id": "p6-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "そんなにいいなら、やらねえ。",
          "en": "If he's that good, I'm not trading."
        },
        {
          "id": "p6-4-2",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "説得の向き、逆でしたね。",
          "en": "You argued in the wrong direction."
        },
        {
          "id": "p6-5-1",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "袋も、取っておくか。",
          "en": "Guess I'll keep the bag too."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 7,
      "panels": {},
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p7-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "充電塔まで、走れ！",
          "en": "Run to the charging tower!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p7-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "来た。",
          "en": "Here it comes."
        },
        {
          "id": "p7-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "今、どう曲がった？",
          "en": "How did it just turn?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p7-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "休めって言われてんだろ。",
          "en": "You were told to rest, weren't you?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p7-4-2",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "caption",
          "ja": "休息推奨",
          "en": "REST RECOMMENDED"
        },
        {
          "id": "p7-5-1",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "……ここからでしたね。",
          "en": "...It starts from here, right."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 8,
      "panels": {},
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p8-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "つながった！",
          "en": "It connected!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "……お前が、つないだのか。",
          "en": "...You're the one who connected it."
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "そこ、誰も見ねえだろ。",
          "en": "Nobody looks at that part."
        },
        {
          "id": "p8-3-2",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "……気になるよな。",
          "en": "...You can't help noticing it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "panels": {},
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p9-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "あそこで、足だけ先に！",
          "en": "There, the legs go first!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p9-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "隊長が受け止める所でしょ。",
          "en": "That's where the Captain catches him."
        },
        {
          "id": "p9-2-2",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "その前の追跡です。",
          "en": "I mean the chase before that."
        },
        {
          "id": "p9-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "マットの下！　見たか！",
          "en": "Under the mat! Did you see?!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p9-3-2",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "そこ？",
          "en": "That part?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p9-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "こちらの空調は、よく効きますね。",
          "en": "The air conditioning here works well."
        },
        {
          "id": "p9-5-1",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "目だけにですか。",
          "en": "Only on the eyes?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "panels": {},
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p10-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "隊長を、お連れしました。",
          "en": "I've brought the Captain."
        },
        {
          "id": "p10-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "格が違うんじゃ？",
          "en": "Weren't they different ranks?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p10-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "モップ丸だ。名前で呼べ。",
          "en": "It's Moppy. Call him by name."
        },
        {
          "id": "p10-4-2",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "あなたが言ったのよ。",
          "en": "You're the one who said it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 11,
      "panels": {},
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p11-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "じゃあ、さっきの交換で――",
          "en": "So, about that trade earlier--"
        },
        {
          "id": "p11-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "あいつがいなきゃ全員止まってた！",
          "en": "Without him, everyone would've stopped!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p11-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "この短え腕で、あそこまで！",
          "en": "With those short arms, he got that far!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p11-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "あの、今は――",
          "en": "Um, right now--"
        },
        {
          "id": "p11-5-1",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "マットの下も！　誰も見ねえのに！",
          "en": "Even under the mat! And nobody looks!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p11-5-2",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "この腕で……。",
          "en": "With these arms..."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 12,
      "panels": {},
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p12-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "これで、磨いてたのよね。",
          "en": "He was polishing with this, right."
        },
        {
          "id": "p12-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "な。だから、交換を――",
          "en": "Right? So, the trade--"
        },
        {
          "id": "p12-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "この子も、置いとく。",
          "en": "I'll keep this one too."
        },
        {
          "id": "p12-3-2",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "なんで欲しくなってんだよ！",
          "en": "Why do you want it now?!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 13,
      "panels": {},
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p13-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "それが、ほしかったんじゃないんですか？",
          "en": "Isn't that the one you wanted?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p13-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "課長、この隊長と……",
          "en": "Chief, this Captain and..."
        },
        {
          "id": "p13-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "これは、私が連れて帰ります。",
          "en": "I'll take this one home."
        },
        {
          "id": "p13-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "あのマットを、広げる時の……",
          "en": "When he spreads out that mat..."
        },
        {
          "id": "p13-5-1",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "そう！　あの間！",
          "en": "Yes! That pause!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p13-5-2",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "交換の話、どこ行ったの。",
          "en": "Where did the trade talk go?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 14,
      "panels": {},
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p14-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "四つ並べて、撮りません？",
          "en": "Shall we line up all four and take a photo?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p14-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "あっ。",
          "en": "Ah."
        },
        {
          "id": "p14-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "小僧、早えな。",
          "en": "Kid, you're quick."
        },
        {
          "id": "p14-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "記者会見かよ！",
          "en": "What is this, a press conference?!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p14-4-2",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "皆さんが手を離せば撮れます。",
          "en": "I can shoot it once everyone lets go."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 15,
      "panels": {},
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p15-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "三、二、一……指。",
          "en": "Three, two, one... finger."
        },
        {
          "id": "p15-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "倒れねえな？",
          "en": "They're not falling, right?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p15-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "今度は顔です。",
          "en": "Now the face."
        },
        {
          "id": "p15-3-2",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "寄りすぎ！",
          "en": "Too close!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p15-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "……もう一枚、いただけますか。",
          "en": "...May I have one more shot?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 16,
      "panels": {},
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p16-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "ここ、少し詰めれば……。",
          "en": "If we squeeze here a little..."
        },
        {
          "id": "p16-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "入る時は、入ってたのに。",
          "en": "They fit when we put them in."
        },
        {
          "id": "p16-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "これでよし。",
          "en": "There. That's done."
        },
        {
          "id": "p16-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "この隊長、角が立つんだよ。",
          "en": "This Captain has sharp corners."
        },
        {
          "id": "p16-5-1",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "持ち主に似たのかしら。",
          "en": "Maybe he takes after his owner."
        },
        {
          "id": "p16-5-2",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "……一枚、借りる。",
          "en": "...I'm borrowing one shot."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 17,
      "panels": {},
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p17-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "最初から、後ろで掃除してました。",
          "en": "He was cleaning in the back from the start."
        },
        {
          "id": "p17-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "なんで早く言わねえ！",
          "en": "Why didn't you say so sooner?!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p17-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "今、そういう話になったので。",
          "en": "Because the conversation only just went there."
        },
        {
          "id": "p17-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "二度目も、忙しいですよ。",
          "en": "The second viewing is busy too."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page": 18,
      "panels": {},
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p18-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "隊長も、欲しかったけどね。",
          "en": "I wanted the Captain too, though."
        },
        {
          "id": "p18-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "今日は二回目でした。",
          "en": "Today was my second time."
        },
        {
          "id": "p18-2-2",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "だから泣くのが早えのか！",
          "en": "So that's why you cry so early!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p18-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "特典だけに、また払うかよ。",
          "en": "Pay again just for a freebie? No way."
        },
        {
          "id": "p18-3-2",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "今、上映時間見てます？",
          "en": "Are you checking the showtimes right now?"
        },
        {
          "id": "p18-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
